OL,3,AOregon teacher fought school attacker
OL,4,Abefore armed dad shot suspect 'multiple
OL,5,Atimes' in class
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe dad who stepped in has been named
OL,8,Fby his family as Kaylub Giamanco, a
OL,9,F"lifelong resident of Bend" with two
OL,10,Fdaughters who attend Silver Rail
OL,11,FElementary
OL,13,FThe attacker has been identified as
OL,14,F16-year-old Griffin John, the BBC's US
OL,15,Fpartner CBS News reports
OL,17,FGriffin was shot dead by a father whose
OL,18,Ftwo daughters attend the school.
OL,20,FBBC Verify looks at how common shooting
OL,21,Fincidents at US schools have become
OL,22,Fover the last 15 years
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
